          "start_s": 9.554954648526078,
          "end_s": 12.864954648526076,
          "text": "No further bulletin will follow at six."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 12.864954648526076,
          "end_s": 19.429954648526078,
          "text": "If you are listening, keep your shelter secure, your water clean and your people warm."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 19.429954648526078,
          "end_s": 24.224954648526076,
          "text": "Remember that you have already survived days without dependable help."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 24.224954648526076,
          "end_s": 26.429954648526078,
          "text": "Take care of each other."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 26.429954648526078,
