          "start_s": 0.18,
          "end_s": 4.495,
          "text": "Kestrel Seven, the supply truck will not reach your site."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 4.495,
          "end_s": 6.89,
          "text": "Do not wait on the road for it."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 6.89,
          "end_s": 10.475,
          "text": "Keep your provisions and use the lookout as your base."
        },
        {
          "start_s": 10.475,
